CORE
main.c
--unwind 3 --rounds 3 --por --allow-pointer-unsoundness --deadlock --mutex-shadow
^EXIT=1$
^SIGNAL=0$
^--mutex-shadow cannot be combined with --deadlock$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The deadlock check finds lock acquisitions by writes to pthread_mutex_t
objects, which --mutex-shadow no longer makes: the combination is refused
(it used to crash).
